        <li>
          Owned the research of core features within largest product line. Collaborated and led studies cross-functionally with Product Managers, Designers, and Developers to drive key product and UX decisions
        </li>
        <li>
          Developed and implemented novel quantitative approaches for modelling User Behavioral Logs. These include, Association Rule Learning, Monte Carlo Markov Chain, etc.
        </li>
        <li> 
          Selected as 1 of 80 presenters (out of 1500+ attendees) at the 2025 Quantitative User Experience Conference to deliver a talk on applying Association Rule Learning to model discrete user behaviors.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </ResumeItem>
    <ResumeItem
